<title>USA: Network Long Distance Inc FY 97 net loss.</title>
<headline>Network Long Distance Inc FY 97 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.30     loss	 $0.14</p>
<p> Net loss		   7,854     loss	   373</p>
<p> Revs			59,700		   30,810</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Years ended March 31.</p>
<p>Results are on a historical basis.</p>
<p>On a proforma basis, reflecting the effect of two recent mergers as if they had occurred at the beginning of the fiscal year, revenues for fiscal 1997 were $108 million, and earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization were $3.3 million.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
